<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        @page { margin: 22px 26px 34px; }
        body { font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9.5px; color: #111; }
        .header { width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid #999; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .header td { vertical-align: middle; }
        .header .logo { width: 80px; }
        .header .logo img { max-height: 60px; max-width: 72px; }
        .header .school { text-align: center; }
        .header .school .name { font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; }
        .header .school .sub { font-size: 10px; color: #444; }
        .title-row { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .title-row td { font-size: 12px; }
        .title-row .right { text-align: right; font-size: 10px; }
        .howto { border: 1px solid #1e3a5f; background: #f1f5fa; padding: 6px 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 9.5px; line-height: 1.45; }
        .howto b { color: #1e3a5f; }
        table.list { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        table.list th, table.list td { border: 1px solid #555; padding: 4px 5px; }
        table.list th { background: #1e3a5f; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; font-size: 9px; }
        table.list tr.class-row td { background: #dfe6ee; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10px; }
        table.list td.n { text-align: center; width: 3%; color: #555; }
        .mono { font-family: Courier, monospace; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: .5px; }
        .activated { color: #555; font-style: italic; }
        .muted { color: #666; font-size: 8.5px; }
        .footer { position: fixed; bottom: -20px; left: 0; right: 0; font-size: 8px; color: #666; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="footer">
        Document confidentiel — contient des accès personnels. À remettre à chaque parent et à détruire ensuite.
        Édité le {{ generated_at|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}.
    </div>

    <table class="header">
        <tr>
            <td class="logo">{% if logo_data %}<img src="{{ logo_data }}" alt="Logo">{% endif %}</td>
            <td class="school">
                <div class="name">{{ school.name|upper }}</div>
                {% if school.sousTutelle %}<div class="sub">{{ school.sousTutelle }}</div>{% endif %}
                {% if school.phone %}<div class="sub">Tél : {{ school.phone }}</div>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td class="logo"></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="title-row">
        <tr>
            <td><b>FICHE D'ACCÈS DES PARENTS — ESPACE PARENT</b></td>
            <td class="right">
                <b>Année scolaire :</b> {{ school_year ? school_year.name : '—' }}<br>
                {{ rows|length }} élève(s){% if reset_count > 0 %} · {{ reset_count }} mot(s) de passe provisoire(s) régénéré(s){% endif %}
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="howto">
        <b>Comment se connecter ?</b>
        Sur le site <b>{{ url('parent_login') }}</b> ou dans l'application mobile <b>EDU-SCHOOL Parent</b>,
        saisir l'<b>identifiant</b> et le <b>mot de passe</b> ci-dessous. À la première connexion, le parent choisit
        son propre mot de passe. « Compte activé » : le parent utilise déjà le mot de passe qu'il a choisi
        (en cas d'oubli, l'administration peut le réinitialiser).
    </div>

    <table class="list">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th class="n">N°</th>
                <th style="width:14%">Matricule</th>
                <th style="width:21%">Élève</th>
                <th style="width:20%">Parent</th>
                <th style="width:11%">Téléphone</th>
                <th style="width:15%">Identifiant</th>
                <th style="width:16%">Mot de passe</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% set current_class = null %}
            {% for row in rows %}
                {% if row.classroom != current_class %}
                    {% set current_class = row.classroom %}
                    <tr class="class-row"><td colspan="7">Classe : {{ current_class }}</td></tr>
                {% endif %}
                {% set student = row.student %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="n">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                    <td>
                        {{ student.matriculeInterne ?: '—' }}
                        {% if student.matriculeNational %}<br><span class="muted">Nat. {{ student.matriculeNational }}</span>{% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td><b>{{ student.lastName|upper }}</b> {{ student.firstName }}</td>
                    <td>{{ row.parent.lastName|upper }} {{ row.parent.firstName }}</td>
                    <td>{{ row.parent.phone ?: '—' }}</td>
                    <td class="mono">{{ row.parent.username }}</td>
                    <td>
                        {% if row.password %}
                            <span class="mono">{{ row.password }}</span><br><span class="muted">provisoire</span>
                        {% else %}
                            <span class="activated">Compte activé</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
